---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SYSmoAI | Commercial AI Systems Work Connected to Emon Hossain"
  description="SYSmoAI is the commercial context for relevant AI systems, workflow automation and operational implementation work connected to Emon Hossain."
  ogTitle="SYSmoAI — Commercial AI Systems & Automation"
>
  <div class="container" style="padding:4rem 1.5rem;max-width:46rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">SYSmoAI</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:1rem;">Commercial AI systems and automation work.</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:1rem;margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.75;">SYSmoAI is the commercial context used for relevant workflow, automation and applied-AI implementation work. It is kept separate from Emon's personal publishing and BangladeshAI.Org's research/public-interest work.</p>

    <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">WORKFLOW DESIGN</div>
        <h3>Map the operating problem</h3>
        <p>Clarify the current process, handoffs, failure modes, ownership and acceptance criteria before selecting tools.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">IMPLEMENTATION</div>
        <h3>Build bounded systems</h3>
        <p>Use low-code automation, structured workspaces and AI-assisted steps where they fit the actual workflow and control requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">HANDOFF</div>
        <h3>Make the system operable</h3>
        <p>Document ownership, exceptions, review points and the definition of done so the workflow is understandable after delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">CLAIM CONTROL</div>
        <h3>Scope before promises</h3>
        <p>Pricing, delivery timelines and outcome claims are confirmed for the specific engagement rather than inherited from old public package pages.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-cta" style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <a href="/services" class="btn-primary">Ways to Work Together</a>
      <a href="https://sysmoai.com" class="btn-outline">Visit SYSmoAI</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
